{
 "_doc": [
  "Terraria's item prefixes (modifiers), read from Terraria.exe: Item.TryGetPrefixStatMultipliersForItem, Item.GetRollablePrefixes, Prefixes, ItemSets, PrefixID.Sets.ReducedNaturalChance, Player.GrantPrefixBenefits and ItemID.Sets.CanGetPrefixes. Names come from ids.json (PrefixID, names.prefixes).",
  "order: which class an item is in, checked in this order (Terraria item ids in classes); an accessory not in no_prefix takes the accessories list.",
  "rollable: the prefixes each class can roll. reduced_natural_chance: rolled naturally (crafted, dropped, in a chest) these stay only 1 time in 3.",
  "stats: per prefix, multipliers of damage, knockback, speed (use time: below 1 is faster), size, velocity (shoot speed) and mana, and crit, tag_damage, armor_pen added; missing ones are 1 (or 0).",
  "accessory: what an accessory prefix adds (the player's stat keys); accessory_value: its value multiplier (Terraria's value is multiplied by the square of the prefix's)."
 ],
